# =================================================
# Unified .gitignore for mcRepos (FrontierMode + Satchel)
#
# Patterns without a leading slash match at any depth, so these apply inside
# both FrontierMode/ and Satchel/ without needing per-mod duplicates. Merged
# from the two mods' original (now-removed) per-repo .gitignore files as part
# of the bare-necessity sanitization pass -- see backhaul/wiki/plans/strip-down.md.
# =================================================

# --------------------
# IDEs
# --------------------
# Eclipse
bin/
.settings/
.metadata/
.classpath
.project
*.launch

# IntelliJ IDEA
# Anchored on purpose: an unanchored `out/` also matches Satchel's source package
# com.arryn.satchel.common.util.out. Only the repo root and each mod's root are IDE output dirs.
/out/
/*/out/
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws

# Visual Studio stray folder (seen at repo root pre-sanitization)
.vs/

# --------------------
# Gradle
# --------------------
.gradle/
build/

# --------------------
# Forge / Minecraft dev
# --------------------
run/
run-data/
run-server/
logs/
saves/
crash-reports/
*.log
*.log.gz
release/

# --------------------
# OS junk
# --------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --------------------
# Forge MDK noise
# --------------------
forge*changelog.txt
forge-*-mdk.zip

# dependency mods (FrontierMode-specific, gitignored in the original repo)
depmods/

# --------------------
# Backhaul
# --------------------
# Per-machine tool config (hardcoded absolute paths -- see FRO_004 for the same
# anti-pattern elsewhere). Not portable, shouldn't be shared.
*.local.json

# Backhaul (board, roadmap tickets, wiki) is live local working state that
# needs to look the same no matter which branch is checked out, not content
# that should vary per-branch like source does. Ignored wholesale -- was
# previously tracked; untracked via `git rm -r --cached backhaul/` in the
# same commit that added this line.
backhaul/
# The generated dashboard at the repo root links only into backhaul/, so it is
# dead on GitHub. Same working state; ignored the same way.
/BACKHAUL.md

# --------------------
# Scrapyard
# --------------------
Scrapyard/assets/
.aider*
